{"4902550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Razor Trail Survivors", "steam_appid": 4902550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Razor Trail Survivors is a semi-idle, persistent multiplayer survival strategy game set in a brutal post-apocalyptic wasteland. Build a settlement, equip your survivors, and carve out your place in a world that never pauses.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the wasteland</strong> — Manage a roster of survivors in a semi-idle, persistent post-apocalyptic world that never pauses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather &amp; craft</strong> — Harvest resources across locations and craft gear and equipment with semi-random quality, levels, mods, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seize &amp; build</strong> — Claim territory tiers, expand your base with buildings like Garden, Warehouse, Barracks, Logistics, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong> — Real-time-driven combat against wasteland enemies and other players (optional).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Factions, bounties &amp; world events</strong> — Band together, hunt bounties, and take part in server-wide events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play anywhere</strong> — One persistent account across desktop (Steam), web, and mobile.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Razor Trail Survivors is a semi-idle, persistent multiplayer survival strategy game set in a brutal post-apocalyptic wasteland. Build a settlement, equip your survivors, and carve out your place in a world that never pauses.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the wasteland</strong> — Manage a roster of survivors in a semi-idle, persistent post-apocalyptic world that never pauses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather &amp; craft</strong> — Harvest resources across locations and craft gear and equipment with semi-random quality, levels, mods, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seize &amp; build</strong> — Claim territory tiers, expand your base with buildings like Garden, Warehouse, Barracks, Logistics, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong> — Real-time-driven combat against wasteland enemies and other players (optional).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Factions, bounties &amp; world events</strong> — Band together, hunt bounties, and take part in server-wide events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play anywhere</strong> — One persistent account across desktop (Steam), web, and mobile.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A semi-idle survival strategy set in a persistent post-apocalyptic wasteland. Recruit survivors, gather resources and craft equipment, seize territory and build your base — and fight other players if you choose. One account across desktop, web, and mobile.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902550/cbb8a713208bcb03ffa49d62c5b0f335be3da895/header.jpg?t=1784877409", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902550/0c16834468fc156e179111cb2ed2f1a0f8a0bb4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784877409", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902550/0c16834468fc156e179111cb2ed2f1a0f8a0bb4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784877409", "website": "https://www.razortrailsurvivors.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GPU with OpenGL 3.0 / DirectX 11 support<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li